# Same board as the sibling scenario, but ai declines Play's "may": Guile's
# replacement still exiled the Bears instead of countering them, and they stay
# in exile, in their owner's (human's) exile zone.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 G
tapformana human 3 G
queue paygeneric G
castspell human 1
tapformana ai 8 U
tapformana ai 9 U
queue targets 1
castspell ai 10
queue confirmeffect false
resolvestack
